  "verseCount": 45,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na inche nigo natenenete komokonya na komobeka chinguru ase omwaka bw’eritang’ani bw’okogaamba kwa Dario Omomedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oborwoti bw’Abamisiri na obw’Abasiiria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bono nkogoteebia inde ayare ay’ekeene. Naama! Abarwoti bande batato nabaoroke ase ense y’Ayemi. Naende omorwoti o kane naoroke, nigo arabe omonda kobua abwo batato bonsi. Ekero aranyore chinguru goetera ase obonda bwaye, naseegete bonsi bagende korwania oborwoti bw’Abagiriki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Erio omorwoti ore ne chinguru chinene naoroke, abe okogaamba nokobua okonene na akore buna anchete ere omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero omorwoti oyio aranyore chinguru chinene, oborwoti bwaye mbosareke bwatananeke ase chinsemo inye chi’ense, tibokoegwa abanto b’ororeria rw’aye, tibokoba nokobua buna koria ere abwate. Oborwoti bwaye mbotegorwe boegwe abanto abaao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omorwoti o Irianyi nabe ne chinguru, korende oyomo bw’abagaambi b’oborwoti bwaye nabe ne chinguru komobua, na oborwoti bwaye mbobe obonene mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma y’emiaka etari meke, omorwoti o Irianyi nakore okobwatana nomorwoti o sugusu. Omorwoti o Irianyi nasokie omoiseke oye ase omorwoti o sugusu ase ogokora okobwatana. Omokungu oyio takogenderera koba nokobua okwo araegwe, na omorwoti oria o sugusu takogenderera koba nokobua kwaye. Omokungu oria narusigweo aitwe, ere amo nabwo bamorentete, oyo omoiborete na oria omoete okobua ase engaki eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omonto natoke korwa ase orosagia rw’omori bw’omokuungu oria, ere naache arwanie abarwani esegi b’omorwoti o sugusu, asoe ase chiburi chiaye, akore ase abanto buna anchete na kobabua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nasakore chinyasae chiabo, na emegwekano yabo bagosasiima ebombire, na ebikorero biabo ebiya biroisirie korwa ase chifeta ne chitaabu, abiire Misiri. Erio ase emiaka emeke natige korwania omorwoti o sugusu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma y’ayio omorwoti o sugusu nache korwania omorwoti o Irianyi, korende goika airane gochia ase ense yaye omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abamura b’omorwoti o sugusu mbebeeke ang’e, basangererie abarwani b’esegi abange mono, oyomo agende agwere ense eria n’omoganda oye omonene oresiarere aande onsi, naende bairane eria kabere barwane gochia bosio bw’eburi yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti oyio o Irianyi nabe nendamwamu enene, nache korwania omorwoti o su-gusu, na oria o sugusu nasangererie omoganda omonene bw’abarwani esegi, korende barabwo nababekwe ase okoboko kw’omorwoti o Irianyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omorwoti oyio o Irianyi arabe osiririe omoganda oria, enkoro yaye inayeimokererie igoro, korende naisa goita chilifu chinyinge, takonyara kobua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omorwoti o sugusu nasangererie omoganda omonene bw’abarwani b’esegi obuete oria bw’eritang’ani, erio magega y’emiaka emeke nairane ore n’omoganda omonene na ebinto ebinge biganeirie ase esegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio eyio abanto bande abange mbaimokere omorwoti o Irianyi, naende abanto abasaria b’egesaku kiao nabeimokererie igoro ase ogwetogia, erinde baikeranie okorora koria aye kwarooche, mbagochwe bagwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omorwoti o Sugusu nache aagache chiburi, abue omochie ogiteire chindwaki. Abarwani esegi b’omorwoti o Irianyi mbabugwe, nonya nabarwani baye abachore tibakonyara kobua, ekiagera mbaborwe chinguru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti oria o sugusu orachere oria o Irianyi, nakore buna aranche; gose monto onde tari oramobue. Oyio natenene ase ense eria ere engiya mono, na ogosirigwa ngoche goetera ase okoboko kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omorwoti oyio o sugusu nakore omooroberio, ache nokobua kw’oborwoti bwaye bwonsi, Nateme gokora okobwatana nomorwoti o Irianyi ase okomoa omoiseke oye abe mok’aye, erinde asarie oborwoti boria kegima, korende amang’ana ayio tagosesenigwa, gose komokonya ere omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma y’ayio naonchokere korwania ebisinka ne chinse chire ang’e nenyancha, nabue ebisinka ebinge ne chinse boigo. Korende omochiki oyomo bw’abarwani b’esegi namobue asirie ogochaaya kwaye, ee, namoiranerie ogochaaya okwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nairane agende ase chiburi chi’ense yaye omonyene, korende nagochwe agwe, takonyorekana naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naende naoroke omorwoti onde ase ribaga riaye, ere natome omobangi bw’ebango aete ase ense eria ere obonene bw’oborwoti bwaye, Ase engaki y’amatuko amake omorwoti oria naitwe, korende tari ase engencho y’endamwamu, gose ase esegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti omobe o Siiria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naende naoroke omorwoti onde omokorekanu ase ribaga ri’oria oitetwe. Oyio ere takoegwa amasikani ase oborwoti obwo. Nigo arache ng’ora ng’ora ase obong’ainereria bw’okweansia aire oborwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nasirie abarwani esegi abange baria baramochere; boigo nasirie omogambi oria arakore okobwatana kw’ogotianania nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma okobwatana kogwakorirwe nere, nakore obong’ainereria, anyore okobua nonya obwate abanto abake boka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo arache ng’ora ng’ora, asoe ase chinsemo chintobu chi’ense eria; nigo arakore amang’ana ayio chisokoro ne chisokoororia chiaye chitakorete. Nasiarere ase egati y’ abanto baye ebinto aureretie, na ebi asakorete, ne chinibo. Nakore emeroberio y’okorwania chiburi chinkong’u, korende ase engaki enke yoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ere nabe noboremu, asangererie abarwani esegi abange mono gochia korwania omorwoti o Irianyi, na omorwoti o Irianyi nere nebeke ang’e korwana esegi nomoganda omonene mono ore ne chinguru, korende takobua, ekiagera nakorerwe emeroberio y’obong’ainereria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto baria bakoria endagera amo nere mbamosirie, na abarwani baye b’esegi mbaserebekane, na abange mbaitwe bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarwoti abwo babere mbabe bakoroberia ng’a bakore amabe, baikaranse ase emesa eyemo babe bagoteebania oborimo, korende ayio tagosesenigwa, na omoerio nigo oraike ase engaki eria echiikire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti oria o sugusu nairane gochia ase ense yaye, aire ebinto ebinge asakoire, na enkoro yaye neroberie mamincha y’okobwatana koria ogochenu, na ekero arabe oikeranirie ayio, nairane gochia ase ense yaye omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naende ase engaki echiikire nairane gochia ase ense ya Irianyi, korende ase engaki eyio amang’ana takoba buna ayio yeritang’ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimeeri chia Kitimu nchiche komorwania, nere noboe atame airane, naonchore ekeririanda kiaye mamincha y’okobwatana ogochenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Ekero arabe oiranire nabe ogotegerera na koigwera abwo batigire okobwatana okwo ogochenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarwani bande b’esegi batometwe nere mbakore Obomenyo Obochenu bobe botachenegeti, nabarusieo ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa gwa kera rituko, na agwo mbatenenie okogechia koria kogosiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo bagokora amabe ase okobwatana okwo ere nabang’use namang’ana y’okweansia goika bagotige kegima, korende abanto baria bamomanyete Nyasae obo mbatenene bokong’u bakore ayabagwenerete bakore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo bare n’obong’aini ase egati y’ abanto mborokererie abange babe nokomanya. Korende ase engaki enke abande babo nabaitwe nemioro, na abande basambwe n’omorero, na abande bairwe ase obosomba, na abande basakorwe ebinto biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero emechando eyio erabachere, abanto ba Nyasae nabanyore ogokonywa ogoke. Abanto abange mbabwatane nabarabwo ase obong’ainereria bw’okweansia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abande b’abwo bare abang’aini nabanyorwe nemechando eyio, erinde ogocheneka kobe ase egati yabo, basibeke goika engaki y’omoerio oyo oraike ase engaki eria echiikire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omorwoti oria nigo arakore buna anchete. Ase obomwenu bwaye neimokererie igoro ase kera enyasae, nakwane amang’ana y’ogokumia mamincha ya Nyasae oyobuete chinyasae chionsi. Nagenderere konyora chinguru goika ekeririanda kia Nyasae geikeranigwe. Aria aroberetigwe ng’a nabe goika aikeranigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti oria tagosika chinyasae chie chisokoro chiaye, gose eye abakungu banchete, gose enyasae ende yonsi, ekiagera neimokererie igoro ase chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ribaga riabo nasike enyasae ekorenda chiburi; enyasae eyio chisokoro chiaye chitamanyete nigo arayesike ase okoyeruera chitaabu, ne chifeta, na amagena ye rigori rinene, na ebiegwa ebiya mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ogokonywa kw’enyasae engeni nekorere chiburi chinkong’u buna anchete. Abanto baria baranche ng’a nomogambi are, nabae obonene bw’ogosikwa. Nababeeke babe abagaambi igoro ase abanto abange na nabaatananere ense ebe eng’eria yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ase engaki y’omoerio omorwoti o Irianyi namoumokere, korende omorwoti oria o sugusu nigo aramorindokere buna ekembugu‐mbugu ore ne chigari, na abariini be chibarasi, ne chimeeri chinyinge. Nigo arasoe ase chinse ao ao nomoganda omonene, aichore aoorie goeterao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Boigo nasoe ase ense eria engiya, nasirie chinse chinyinge, korende Abaedomu na Abamoabu, na abanto abange b’Abaamoni, barabwo mbatoorigwe korwa ase okoboko kwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Narambore okoboko kwaye asirie chinse chinyinge, na ense ya Misiri tegotooreka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabe nokobua igoro ye chikungo chi’echitaabu ne chifeta, na igoro y’ebinto bi’erigori rinene bia Misiri. Abanto ba Libia na ab’Ethiopia mbabe bakobwatia chimbaratero chiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende amang’ana ararwe moocha na sugusu namoichanie, erio asoke ore nekeririanda ekenene aite abanto abange abasirie kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natenenie eema yaye y’oborwoti ebe ase egati y’enyancha na egetunwa keria egechenu ki’obonene. Korende nonya naboigo naikere omoerio oye, na monto onde tari oramokoonye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
